{
  "id": "3cdc23ab-0e71-4ea4-aa6e-8e4204a71742",
  "but": "faire connaissance entre chatons ; se reposer ; le Cœur et l’Amitié",
  "titre": "Vers l’inconnu et au-delà",
  "statut": "prete",
  "encarts": [
    {
      "id": "a334220f-6490-47a9-9ed1-57266467d0f5",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "032a1f8f-68cf-43b8-9871-eaa604c51e94",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Vous arrivez aux limites du royaume. La nuit tombe : il faut se reposer.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "parties": [
        {
          "id": "380faedb-fb9b-45f4-8e7f-f331649fbc42",
          "typeId": "53857dd5-4db0-4e8e-983b-d55b52cfecfc",
          "contenu": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "S’ils sont venus en charrette : ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "64c9b28d-be9f-42e3-834f-ef869a072114",
                      "label": "Anatole",
                      "nature": "pnj",
                      "mentionSuggestionChar": "@"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " et ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "996bfb46-017b-49b6-9307-3e5de7e8b1ee",
                      "label": "Picotin",
                      "nature": "pnj",
                      "mentionSuggestionChar": "@"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " les laissent là, les encouragent et leur donnent quelques friandi",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "35d0eb1d-b6e9-4b59-b5fe-5d17aaf438b6",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "032a1f8f-68cf-43b8-9871-eaa604c51e94",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Vous trouvez un petit bosquet calme, près d’un panneau qui indique la ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "c7e176f0-0657-42d4-95e7-b1db54bdafb6",
                  "label": "Casse-Auto",
                  "nature": "lieu"
                }
              },
              {
                "text": " et la ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "56c9ae0c-56bc-4eed-a97d-c332e8d4d156",
                  "label": "Forêt endormie",
                  "nature": "lieu"
                }
              },
              {
                "text": ".",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "parties": [
        {
          "id": "9986bc26-d69d-4966-b021-c63c50e602fd",
          "typeId": "28e4864d-d053-433c-8491-5110a3f1785c",
          "contenu": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Mettez en scène un moment calme : faites connaissance, jouez, chantez…",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "54bb9ea3-812c-4ee8-aac8-14e85ff703bd",
          "typeId": "08744da8-f883-4424-aeb1-0f8554a83833",
          "contenu": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Une nuit au calme rend 1 Cœur à chaque chaton",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "c4aea1eb-c474-442c-b58d-5e4b54c25f40",
          "typeId": "08744da8-f883-4424-aeb1-0f8554a83833",
          "contenu": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Si moment convivial entre chatons ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "080de0c0-c67c-426b-a61d-ff55b10ccb4d",
          "typeId": "53857dd5-4db0-4e8e-983b-d55b52cfecfc",
          "contenu": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Gros câlin : un chaton peut dépenser 1 Amitié pour rendre 1 Cœur à un compagnon.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Dormir ensemble au calme est un beau moment partagé : chaque chaton regagne 1 Amitié",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "1bbf0c8c-2650-4993-8f74-25bfa2d08871",
          "typeId": "08744da8-f883-4424-aeb1-0f8554a83833",
          "contenu": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "63e0815a-642e-49cc-a858-2f86240b2e3a",
                      "label": "Cœur",
                      "nature": "regle",
                      "mentionSuggestionChar": "@"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " · ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "dc49788b-13c3-4e2c-b960-7db9591e4519",
                      "label": "Amitié",
                      "nature": "regle",
                      "mentionSuggestionChar": "@"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9d8497ec-7574-4175-99a1-e97ba774d695",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "032a1f8f-68cf-43b8-9871-eaa604c51e94",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Pendant la nuit, vous entendez au loin des hurlements, des bruits, de la mécanique…",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "parties": [
        {
          "id": "183800e2-94ec-4117-886c-b6e1aea5c958",
          "typeId": "53857dd5-4db0-4e8e-983b-d55b52cfecfc",
          "contenu": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Ce sont les chiens de la casse ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b9b00f90-69e5-4cfa-9df3-06d9bad7ac6e",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "0f601108-ce80-4f5f-b790-368ddc11ee29",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Au réveil, les chatons sont en forme : ils ont bien dormi. Mais ils sont toujours perdus. Que leur réserve l’avenir ?",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "lieuIds": [
    "d61e3286-be58-4a97-aa70-2a3f5d4b8fb7"
  ],
